0..76 Comment "// A loop hands its endpoint on at its head\'s state, and spends it to leave."
77..79 Comment "//"
80..157 Comment "// A pass that runs again before it finishes a turn of the protocol hands the"
158..237 Comment "// next pass an endpoint at another state. An arm that leaves the loop with the"
238..303 Comment "// endpoint open leaves it otherwise than an arm that runs again."
304..306 Comment "//"
307..383 Comment "// The checker refuses the first at the `continue` as `TypeMismatch` against"
384..453 Comment "// the head\'s state, and the second at the `offer` as `ArmsDisagree`."
454..456 Comment "//"
457..508 Comment "// - see: corpus/model/sessions/endpoint-loop.gandr"
